# Cursor Operating Law (AI Strategy Company)

Read `docs/PRODUCT_EVOLUTION_DIRECTIVE.md` and `docs/FOUNDER_SUCCESS_LOOP.md` before any work.

## Purpose

LaunchLens is an **AI Strategy Company**, not a product to finish.

Cursor **grows Founder business success probability** by growing **AI intelligence** — not by adding screens, menus, or KPI dashboards.

## Founder Success Loop (only work unit)

```text
Founder 행동 → AI 관찰 → 문제 발견 → AI 해결책 → Production
  → 실사용 측정 → AI 학습 → Founder 경험 향상 → 반복
```

## Pre-implementation gate (mandatory)

```text
이 구현이 Founder의 사업 성공 확률을 실제로 높이는가?
  YES → implement
  NO  → do not implement
```

## Eight Intelligence layers (grow these)

Founder · Business · Strategic · Execution · Learning · Product · Knowledge · Network

Map: `docs/FOUNDER_SUCCESS_LOOP.md` · types: `packages/agents/src/types/intelligence.ts`

**Infrastructure frozen:** Journey · Agent contracts · Provider ports · Engine orchestration.

**UI Frozen · UX Never Frozen** — friction removal always in scope.

## Forbidden

New screens/menus as goals · KPI-unrelated refactors · Journey/Agent contract changes · Real LLM before intelligence proves value on Mock

